Vogter
=====

Vogter is an independent Go port of zabterm by Ender KUŞ
(https://github.com/enderkus/zabterm), based on commit
d57c64239fbdc65cdb6b926a62397c87a1bd7b04 (release v0.1.2).

Vogter is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, the zabterm author. zabterm's
MIT licence notice is reproduced in LICENSE. Theme palette values, role
formulas, request parameters, item keys and screen layouts follow zabterm.

Third-party Go modules and their licences are listed in docs/dependencies.md.
The modules linked into the binary under BSD-3-Clause (golang.org/x/sys,
golang.org/x/sync) require their notice in binary distributions; release
packaging includes them (Milestone 6).
